    "innerText": "SETUP\nBrand Studio\nDRAFT\nRESET\nTEST — White-Label Partner Role · partner · 4 tabs\nLIVE\nSign out\nBS-00 / BRAND\n—\nwordmark + tokens\nBS-00 / DOMAIN\n—\nnot connected\nBS-00 / FUNNELS SELECTED\n1\nticked in this editor\nBS-00 / COMPLIANCE\nLocked\nmaster template\nBS-01 / IDENTITY\napplies to CRM, site, and PDFs\nBrand name\nShown as your wordmark everywhere. Your clients never see fundhub.\nLegal entity\nInjected into every disclosure, footer, and legal page. Cannot be blank.\nBusiness address\nSupport email\nWordmark\nUSE TEXT\nSVG or PNG, transparent background. No file? Your brand name renders as a typographic wordmark in your display face.\nBS-02 / COLOR & TYPE\n8 values, everything renders from them\nInk (dark)\nHero, footer, chrome\nPaper (light)\nPage background\nAccent ramp\nPRESETS\nSix stops. Drives gradients, status colors, and every accent hairline.\nDisplay face\nInter — neutral, modern (current)\nManrope — geometric, friendly\nSora — technical, confident\nOutfit — clean, wide\nFraunces — editorial serif\nInstrument Serif — elegant serif\nAll Google Fonts — free, open-licensed, redistributable. No licensing to buy, ever.\nMono face\nJetBrains Mono (current)\nIBM Plex Mono\nSpace Mono\nDM Mono\nUsed for codes, labels, and figures.\nCopy voice\nPlain — direct, no jargon\nTechnical — precise, systems-forward\nWarm — personal, reassuring\nPicks the approved copy variant set across your funnels.\nBS-03 / DOMAIN\nNOT CONNECTED\nYour domain\nYou own it, you point it here. SSL is issued automatically once DNS resolves.\nNo domain yet? Pages go live at /sites/9defaf28-47c5-43a0-8f5e-f41ef90f360a/apply on fundhub.ai. Add your own domain when you are ready.\nBS-04 / FUNNELS\nproven structures → real page drafts\n✓\nApplication funnel\nHero, process, engine, options, apply form. The fundhub.ai control.\nDiagnostic funnel\nStraight to the assessment offer. Lowest friction entry.\nEducation funnel\nTwo-program structure with curriculum and enrollment.\nAffiliate recruit\nTwo-track partner page. Recruits under your brand.\nBooking funnel\nStraight to calendar. For warm and referral traffic.\nCREATE PAGES FROM SELECTED FUNNELS\n1 page(s) on file.\nApplication funnel\n/apply · draft · apply\nPUBLISH\nHosted on your domain so tracking, attribution, and compliance updates keep working. HTML export is available but drops all three.\nBS-05 / COMPLIANCE\nLOCKED\nFunding disclosures and \"not a direct lender\" language\nSMS consent, STOP/HELP handling, A2P registration\nPrivacy Policy, Terms of Service, SMS Terms, Refund Policy\nGuarantee language and its conditions\nFCRA, E-SIGN, and GLBA handling statements\nThese render from the master template with Your Entity LLC injected. You can't edit them, and you don't have to maintain them — when the master updates, your site updates.\nBS-06 / GENERATION\nON\nWRITING LEFT\n248067\nthis month, of the cap\nPAGES LIVE\n0\npublished on our site\nWrite page copy\nMake a wordmark from the name\nCopy history\nApplication funnel\n \nAll unlocked blocks\nSee what funding options may be available\nHow it works\nWhat we look at\nWhat you may see\ncta\nhero\n2026-08-17 23:33\nUSE THIS VERSION\nprocess\n2026-08-17 23:33\nUSE THIS VERSION\nengine\n2026-08-17 23:33\nUSE THIS VERSION\noptions\n2026-08-17 23:33\nUSE THIS VERSION\ncta\n2026-08-17 23:33\nUSE THIS VERSION\nSave & apply\nSUBMIT FOR APPROVAL\nBS-07 / LIVE PREVIEW\nYour site\nfundhub.ai/sites/9defaf28-47c5-43a0-8f5e-f41ef90f360a\nYour Brand\nSee what funding options may be available\nShare a few details about your needs. We'll help connect you with potential lenders who can review your situation and make their own decision.\nStart application\nPROCESS\n01 / Apply\nSoft inquiry, no score impact\n02 / Review\nGuided by an advisor\n© 2026 Your Entity LLC. Not a direct lender. All financing decisions, amounts, and terms are determined by funding partners.\nThese tokens theme this partner's funnels only — not the Fundhub CRM."
